    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds so much more peaceful than just being here to watch it all fail. i'm just so tired of the noise and the mess. it feels like if i just... left, i wouldn't have to feel the weight of it anymore. do you think people actually find peace in that? just choosing to stop?",
